practicing a little too much?

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:03.310
I-I'm not saying we should just take it easy,

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:07.770
but Tao has a point. If we keep going
at the pace of yesterday and today,

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:09.840
eventually someone's going to get injured.

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:12.800
And with only nine players,
it's kinda reckless.

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:22.690
I don't think it's all that reckless.

