after a message like that.

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:01.410
We're bein' tested.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:04.870
I ain't namin' names, but he got mad 'cause 
someone ain't happy with the schedule.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.580
You talking about me, Anita?

00:17:07.820 --> 00:17:09.070
I, uh, no—

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:10.050
Tao.

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:13.830
I didn't come get you today, 
so I'm glad you showed up.

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:15.160
I thought you might no-show.

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:18.470
Honestly, at first, I considered staying home.

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:21.520
But then I decided I wasn't
gonna be driven out quietly.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:23.930
I came here to throw down with Daigo.

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:26.050
Th-Throw down?

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:29.370
How long are ya gonna
keep makin' lame excuses?

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:31.790
Ya talk 'bout injuries, an' how
we only have nine players,

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:33.890
but they're all jus' excuses to skip practice!

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:35.280
I'm on our captain's side on this one—

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.650
You're still not done?! We wan—

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:37.610
Get out!

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.180
Tell me.

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:43.750
What's up with your right hand?

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:46.210
You still can't take off this brace.

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:48.170
It's never going to heal!

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:53.780
I'm saying there's such a thing as overworking.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:57.250
Yayoi's elbow blew out when
we were in Little because of it.

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:01.010
I never want to see 
something like that again.

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:05.870
Daigo's got total tunnel vision right now.

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:11.030
I-I've got terrible news.

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:13.020
I just heard from his mom.

00:18:13.020 --> 00:18:14.280
D-Daigo's...

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:17.900
No way...

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.520
Shigeno

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.520
Shigeno

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:51.630
Thanks for coming over.

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:52.270
No problem.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.940
The day before yesterday, he had a fever,

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:57.880
