00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.340
What in the world are you doing?

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:25.990
It's fine, really. Look, I'm—

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:27.470
Put that down!

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:29.680
Jeez.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:32.070
We were so worried about you.

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:34.690
We were told you were
taken away in an ambulance.

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:38.400
Well, I collapsed on a Sunday, 
so all the clinics around here were closed.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.110
How's everyone doing?

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:43.210
Everyone's fine, like always.

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:44.910
We had practice today like usual.

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:46.510
I see.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:52.790
But we weren't all that
efficient without you there.

